        "body": "This pull request adds several new features and improvements to the student activities management app. The main changes include expanding the list of available activities, introducing the ability to unregister students from activities (both backend and frontend), displaying participants for each activity in the UI, and adding comprehensive backend tests to ensure correct behavior.\n\n**Backend enhancements:**\n\n* Added several new activities to the `activities` data structure, each with descriptions, schedules, and initial participants.\n* Implemented an endpoint to unregister a student from an activity, with proper error handling for unknown activities or students not signed up.\n\n**Frontend improvements:**\n\n* Displayed the list of participants for each activity, including an \"unregister\" button for each participant to remove them from the activity via the new backend endpoint.\n* Updated the activity selection dropdown to always include a default option when activities are fetched.\n* Ensured the activities list is refreshed after a successful signup to reflect changes immediately.\n\n**Styling updates:**\n\n* Added new CSS classes to style the participants section, participant list, and unregister button for a more user-friendly display.\n\n**Testing improvements:**\n\n* Added a new test suite (`tests/test_app.py`) covering activity listing, signup, duplicate signup prevention, unregistration, and error cases for unknown activities or participants not signed up.",
